{"id":"triste","lemma":"triste","pos":"adj","rank":674,"glosses":["As a temporary state.","As a trait.","dismal, dreary, glum, miserable, melancholic"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾiste/","forms":{"femininePlural":"tristes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-triste.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom se sentía triste.","en":"Tom felt sad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799024"},{"text":"¿Por qué están tristes?","en":"Why are you sad?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442331"},{"text":"Ella se veía triste.","en":"She looked sad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441125"},{"text":"¿Por qué están tan tristes?","en":"Why are you so sad?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44347"},{"text":"¡Qué día tan triste!","en":"What a sad day!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523541"}]}